        "original_id": "15e9afcf-874e-53af-88c2-12f266727620",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Peverett, Jang Hyun-seung\n- Roles: singer, musician, lead vocalist, rhythm guitarist\n- Organizations: Foghat, Savoy Brown\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Peverett was born on 16 April 1943 and died on 7 February 2000.\n- Dave Peverett, also known as Lonesome Dave, was an English singer and musician.\n- Dave Peverett was the original lead vocalist and rhythm guitarist of the rock band Foghat.\n- Dave Peverett founded Foghat after his tenure in Savoy Brown.\n- Jang Hyun-seung was born on September 3, 1989.\n- Jang Hyun-seung, most often credited as Hyunseung, is a South Korean singer.",
